ates have access to  basic health care  Missouri only had one abortion clinic  left before Roe fell due in part to  lobbyists like Sam Lee of campaign life  Missouri an anti-abortion Rights group  we think it's very irresponsible for  Planned Parenthood trying to solicit  Missouri women and then when a woman has  a complication where can she go back to  to get help when that abortion van is  gone instead Lee wants to see more  resources go to alternatives for  pregnant women here in Missouri like  pregnancy centers and housing help it  always comes down to for women who are  unsure about their decision or are being  coerced into their decision being given  true choices  with so many raw emotions being  expressed on both sides of this issue we  were really thoughtful about the  security and safety of the unit the RV  is equipped with cameras and will  initially have a security guard still Dr  mcnicholas says this is the time to push  boundaries we're really at a critical  moment a Public Health crisis where we  need folks to be thinking differently to  be working together  to be acting boldly and to be taking  risks for CBS mornings I'm Adriana Diaz  in Southern Illinois
 

